      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. ROSENBERG: Mr. Chief Justice, and may it please the Court: The State's exemption violates Section 111 and this Court's precedents because it facially discriminates based on the source of the compensation, as only retirement benefits from state retirement plans are exempted, and the State cannot show any significant differences between retired employees of the U.S. Marshals Service and the exempted state retirees because the State concedes that their job duties are the same. This Court should reverse."
    },
