      "evidence_id": "ev-fef54ebfe86b-0001-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 31,
        "start": 31
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Right. That's what the State has argued, Your Honor. They attempted to say that the -- the logic of their exemption, although it's facially discriminatory, actually turns on things like contribution rates or whether the employees contribute to Social Security."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
      "case_id": "2018-17-419",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "fef54ebfe86be0cc2207d9b6a119fb160378e0c8df1ba3bc86047e36ea3685cf",
