      "text": "JUSTICE KAVANAUGH: Okay. And your opposing counsel says in that circumstance where you're similar to both the favored and the disfavored state employees, that the state is required to go with the favored state employees as the treatment for the federal employees, if you're following me. Why is your opposing counsel wrong on that point?"
